&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Operational Excellence Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; sits within the UK Operational Excellence team and plays a key role in designing, executing, and scaling high-impact continuous improvement initiatives across HelloFresh distribution centres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Positioned as a senior technical practitioner and project leader, you will handle complex, cross-functional projects aimed at optimizing fulfillment processes, reducing costs, and improving error rates. You will bridge high-level strategy and floor-level execution by collaborating closely with the OpEx Team Lead on roadmap implementation while mentoring junior engineers and leading site-level project teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Project Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-impact, multi-faceted continuous improvement projects from end-to-end to drive major KPI improvements across site operations (cost per box, error rate, throughput).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply Lean Six Sigma methodologies, root-cause analysis, and structured problem-solving tools to solve complex operational bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap Delivery Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the OpEx Team Lead and site operational leaders to translate the broader OpEx strategy into actionable project plans.&lt;/li&gt;
