&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency in data analytics tools (Excel, SQL, Google Sheets) and hands-on familiarity with WMS/WCS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Aptitude:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with low-code/no-code platforms or modern automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to lead project teams and mentor junior team members without needing formal direct reporting lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills with the ability to influence cross-functional teams and present updates to site leadership clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Floor Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong desire to blend strategic thinking with hands-on, floor-level problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
